                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, during the @HouseVetAffairs Health Subcommittee hearing, I advocated for more accessible telehealth care for our veterans. I also discussed with our witnesses the new, promising TBI and PTSD medical treatments for veterans. https://t.co/09t5sEwS2g",
